WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:26.470
Rina!

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.930
Just when I was relieved that one was gone,

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.290
another one came from Dotsuku Zone.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.270
We managed to protect Mepple and Mipple,

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:44.670
but they might send someone else after us.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:51.170
I'm a little relieved that the Guardian of 
Prism Stones will protect the precious Prism Stone,

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.720
and we even got Field of Light 
diaries from this guardian.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.740
But I don't have time to 
think about those things.

00:00:57.990 --> 00:00:59.830
Starting tomorrow, we have 
important league games.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.070
I have to do my best.

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:02.300
Nagisa!

00:01:06.430 --> 00:01:08.470
I'm sorry! Are you okay?

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:12.160
I should apologize! I wasn't watching.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.050
Yukishiro-san!

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:20.390
Good luck tomorrow.

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.190
I'll be there to root for you.

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:24.330
You will?

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.590
In that case, I'd better 
show you what I can do.

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:32.970
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:35.770
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:38.610
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:42.880
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.850
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:48.720
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.620
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.530
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:54.530 --> 00:01:56.130
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:57.630 --> 00:02:01.930
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:04.040
<i>become stronger</i>

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:07.810
<i>and closer</i>

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.810
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:14.380
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:17.550
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:20.420
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:26.690
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:27.590
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:30.290
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:33.100
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:36.000
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.570
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:40.640
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.570
We have to win today.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.570
In order to get to the final tournament,

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.790
we'll have to win one of the league games.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:04.710
Got that?

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:07.560
We're going to defeat Otakagu Girls' 
Middle School in this first game!

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:09.730
We're definitely going to win!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.000
Let's go!

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.740
I hope you will.

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:16.380
Vice Principal...!

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:21.210
As you all know, Otakagu Girls' 
Middle School is the rival school

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:25.720
to our venerable Verone Girls' School.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:29.360
It's inexcusable for our school to lose to 
them in scholarly pursuits or in sports.

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:30.530
Do you understand everyone?

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:32.180
You will win no matter what it takes!

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.830
Nagisa!

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.780
Fight, Nagisa!

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:53.420
The way the head teacher talks 
always rubs me the wrong way.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.510
You're right.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.630
Just forget about that.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.240
Let's do what we always do.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.690
She's here!

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:05.790
Yukishiro-san!

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:10.480
That's...

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:27.250
"A BITTER LACROSSE BATTLE!
 A MAIDEN'S HEART IS SUPER DELICATE"

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:36.150
What is that? What's going on?

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:39.680
Calm down! I have to calm down.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:45.060
That's Misumi-san. She's our lacrosse ace.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.320
She's only in her second year, 
and she's already an ace...?

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.040
That's awesome!

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:51.100
She's very athletic.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:54.500
That's unusual for one 
of your friends, Honoka.

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.620
Friend?

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:02.500
That's true... I guess you 
could say she's my friend.

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:04.480
We have a strange relationship.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:08.850
Concentrate! Concentrate!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.200
I have to concentrate!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.080
Yumiko!

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:27.200
Pass!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.170
Good! Very good!

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.340
Nagisa!

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.180
Darn!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:43.470
Shiho! Stick close to her!

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:51.600
Push her to the side!

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:12.600
What are they doing?

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:22.110
What was that anyway?

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:35.240
You not only didn't get the Prism 
Stones that they're holding,

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:39.220
but there's no sign of the 
Prism Stone that Pisard had.

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:43.160
They're threatening our eternity.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:46.080
Don't take their power lightly.

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.720
Find a way to use Zakenna.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.550
Do you understand Gekidrago?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.860
That was so close!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:14.710
That's strange... I wonder what's wrong?

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.970
It looks like the ace is 
having a bad day today.

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:26.760
What's going on anyway?

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:29.910
The game isn't over yet.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:31.550
You're absolutely right.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.560
We'll be waiting for you 
at the finals tournament.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:41.090
How embarrassing! That's 
the end of the Verone name.

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:45.010
There's always tomorrow.

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:47.270
You're absolutely right.

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:50.910
What happened to you today?

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.240
I'm sorry.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:54.380
Let's do our best tomorrow.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:17.570
Good work.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.240
Yukishiro-san...

00:08:19.550 --> 00:08:22.180
Too bad about the game.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.420
You waited for me just to tell me that?

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:29.550
Actually, Mipple wanted to see Mepple.

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:38.370
The two of you are just as close as ever...

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.390
How nice for you!

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:43.280
Did something happen today, Misumi-san?

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:47.370
You weren't your usual self.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:49.830
No... not really.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:53.720
If you say so...

00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.960
I'll come to watch you again tomorrow.

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:56.800
Do your best.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:00.280
You're coming again tomorrow?

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:01.650
Don't you want me to?

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:03.660
It's not that!

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.280
I didn't want you to force yourself...

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.500
It's no trouble at all.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:12.590
Really? The person you were with today...

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:15.160
What?

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:18.560
It's nothing!

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.390
I didn't know those two were that close...

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:42.180
Are they friends, or are they...?

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.070
I heard you lost.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.530
Be quiet!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:55.840
Lacrosse isn't everything.

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:58.340
There's always studying and falling in love.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:02.810
Oh, sorry! That's probably 
even more unlikely.

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:05.180
Just be quiet!

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:09.320
Let me go! I give up!

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:19.280
I'm late! I'm late!

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.750
What's wrong, both of you?

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.290
Is that our opponent for today?

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:34.530
That's right...

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.620
Kakutokan University Affiliated 
Girls' Middle School...

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:37.570
Are you serious?

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.250
They don't look like they're 
middle school students.

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:42.360
They just started their 
lacrosse team this year.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:44.440
Didn't they get the judo team by mistake?

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:47.250
If we run into those girls, 
we'll break our bones.

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.530
We might die!

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:50.720
I'm going home.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:52.290
Wait a minute!

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:56.620
You both know that we absolutely 
can't lose today's game, don't you?

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.270
You're absolutely right.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:00.160
He's here again.

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.370
Please take that to heart.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:05.750
If you should lose,

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:09.340
we'll be defeated in the preliminary 
round for the first time in history.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:12.320
Let me warn you, Misumi.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:16.770
I don't want to see a repeat 
of yesterday's shameful play.

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:20.150
Just because he's the head teacher...

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:31.550
Is she alone today?

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:34.320
Honoka... Honoka!

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:37.500
What is it?

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:39.690
I sense something mipo.

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:42.470
Something's coming closer mipo!

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:43.900
Are you sure?

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.040
That's...!

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:20.680
He's coming this way!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.220
Over here... I'm over here!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:29.800
You're kidding mipo!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.470
What in the world are you doing, Honoka?

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:34.210
If he goes into the playing field,

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.220
he'll cause a huge commotion.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:38.730
And he'll ruin the game!

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.120
It's time, everybody!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:14.860
Are you all ready?

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:16.500
Let's put our hearts into it.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.570
Nagisa!

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:20.150
It's terrible mepo!

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:22.740
What's all the fuss?

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.600
I can't sense Mipple's presence anymore.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:28.490
What are you saying? She's right there...

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:31.880
Mipple's in danger! I just know it!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.490
Are you serious?

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:35.470
Look for her!

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:38.510
Hurry!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:45.530
Misumi! The game is about to begin!

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.330
Where? Where is she?

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:54.270
Hey, Misumi! Where are you?

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.750
Hand over the stones!

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.190
No! I won't!

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.890
We.. we couldn't find her anywhere!

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:09.290
I see...

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:13.190
How could Nagisa do this at 
an important time like this?

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:16.640
It can't be helped.

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:21.140
The stones!

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:25.840
Stay away! I refuse to hand them over to you!

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:28.300
Mepple! Hurry mipo!

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.740
Wait a minute!

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:34.700
Misumi-san!

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:35.790
Mepple!

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:38.160
Yukishiro-san!

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:40.140
Transform mepo!

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:57.470
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:41.880
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.750
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.620
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:52.020
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:55.470
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.930
I'm not going back!

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.820
What are you doing here?

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:09.870
Vice Principal!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.460
You're not supposed to be in here!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:18.220
What in the world are you doing here?

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.970
No! Don't!

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:21.990
I don't believe this!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:26.190
Think of a way to use Zakenna!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.750
Zakenna!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:33.380
Show them how frightening the 
power of darkness can be!

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:38.920
Zakenna!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.680
Vice Principal!

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:48.880
What do you think you're doing?

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.730
Zakenna!

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:03.300
I've had enough!

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:07.850
I'm trying harder than anyone else!

00:17:07.850 --> 00:17:09.610
I go to school earlier than everyone else!

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:12.700
And I'm the last one to leave!

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:13.550
Uga! Uga!

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:17.720
I'm the one who has to 
clean up after everyone.

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:20.250
Ever since I became a teacher, 
I've never let it slip even once.

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:24.520
When you take off your shoes,
 put them in the shoe box where they belong!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.210
Like yesterday!

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:30.660
Who was it that was running down 
the hallway with their shoes on?

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:33.540
It took a really long time to wipe it!

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.640
Misumi-san...?

00:17:35.440 --> 00:17:36.970
I was in a hurry!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:43.230
Everybody just does their own thing!

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.680
What are you doing anyway, Nagisa?

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:58.660
Hurry, and get back here, Nagisa!

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:01.060
Never mind that!

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.610
I can't take it anymore!

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.070
Nagisa will come back.

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:07.100
Until then, you all have 
to try to hang in there!

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:11.450
Students don't listen to what I tell them!

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.320
Talking behind my back!

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.770
I... I...

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.190
He seems quite stressed!

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:19.110
What are we going to do?

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.930
We have no choice... We need to get him!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:27.200
I want to be a principal.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:32.550
You're in the way!

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:36.460
Is that any way to listen 
to what I have to say?

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.400
Now!

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.560
Black Thunder!

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:48.480
White Thunder!

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:05.300
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:08.280
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:19:10.030 --> 00:19:13.300
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:32.670
Zakenna!

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:36.530
Gomenna! Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:38.270
Gomenna! Gomenna!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:47.660
Yukishiro-san...?

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:50.740
Are you alone today?

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:54.130
There was someone sitting 
next to you yesterday.

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:56.710
Oh, you mean Fujimura-kun?

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:58.740
Is he a friend?

00:19:58.740 --> 00:19:59.610
It's more like...

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:01.230
More like...?

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:03.250
We're childhood friends.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:05.570
Childhood friends?

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:08.600
That's right. We've been playing 
together since we were little...

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.550
He's like a big brother to me.

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:12.450
Is that right?

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:14.600
What about Fujimura-kun?

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:17.960
That's okay. I have to hurry back.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:19.720
Good luck!

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:22.700
So, they're childhood friends.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:30.470
Nagisa! Where were you?

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.810
I'm sorry, everybody!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.180
Hurry and get in here, Nagisa!

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:37.980
Don't worry, everybody!

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:40.050
Just believe in yourself!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.880
We're going to come from behind and win this!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:46.800
Pass to Nagisa!

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:49.440
Nagisa!

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:52.320
Nagisa!

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:54.090
Nagisa!

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:57.300
I'm Verone Academy's lacrosse team's...

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:02.760
Nagisa Misumi!

00:21:12.850 --> 00:21:14.480
There's no time left.

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:16.440
Let's do it everybody!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.270
Yumiko!

00:21:28.160 --> 00:21:29.620
Nagisa!

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:33.010
Go!

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:50.720
We did it!

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:53.840
Magnificent!

00:21:56.050 --> 00:21:57.290
I'm so glad!

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:25.390
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.220 --> 00:22:29.330
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.330 --> 00:22:30.060
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.630 --> 00:22:32.660
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:35.700
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

